{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EmptyView","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You will rarely, if ever, need to create an ","type":"text"},{"code":"EmptyView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" directly. Instead,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"EmptyView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" represents the absence of a view.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenSwiftUI uses "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EmptyView"},{"type":"text","text":" in situations where a OpenSwiftUI view type defines one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or more child views with generic parameters, and allows the child views to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be absent. When absent, the child view’s type in the generic type parameter"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EmptyView"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example creates an indeterminate "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProgressView"},{"type":"text","text":" without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a label. The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProgressView"},{"type":"text","text":" type declares two generic parameters,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Label"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CurrentValueLabel"},{"type":"text","text":", for the types used by its subviews."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"When both subviews are absent, like they are here, the resulting type is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProgressView<EmptyView, EmptyView>"},{"type":"text","text":", as indicated by the example’s output:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let progressView = ProgressView()","print(\"\\(type(of:progressView))\")","\/\/ Prints: ProgressView<EmptyView, EmptyView>"],"syntax":null}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EmptyView","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/emptyview"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI9EmptyViewV","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EmptyView"}],"title":"EmptyView","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EmptyView"}],"role":"symbol"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EmptyView\/init()"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EmptyView\/body-swift.property"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"title":"Type Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EmptyView\/Body-swift.typealias"],"anchor":"Type-Aliases"},{"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EmptyView\/View-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s15BitwiseCopyableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/View"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A view that doesn’t contain any content."}],"hierarchy":{"pat